Initialization
units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p f

System Construction
lattice bcc 3.300
region proj block 0 20 0 20 0 20
region targ block 0 20 0 20 21 60
region whole union 2 proj targ
create_box 1 whole
create_atoms 1 region proj
create_atoms 1 region targ
group projectile region proj
group target region targ

Potential
pair_style eam
pair_coeff * * /home/holbrooe/LAMMPS-AST/publication/potentials/prompt3.potential Nb

Miscellaneous
velocity all create 300 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix eq all nvt temp 300 300 0.1
timestep 0.001
run 10
unfix eq

variable gap equal 1.5/3.3
displace_atoms target move 0 0 ${gap} units lattice

velocity projectile set 0 0 -2000 units box

Production Run
fix nve all nve
run 10
